> **My tactical advice:**  
> For the seminar, emphasize three things: **heterogeneity**, **external validity**, and **policy relevance**. This audience will likely press on whether GDP-temperature estimates identify causal climate damages, how you reconcile short-run weather shocks with long-run warming, and whether meta-analysis can discipline structural IAM assumptions.
